        "summary": "Every detail of F-1 racing comes to the Game Boy with FASTEST LAP. Challenge the clock and try to get the best time on one of 16 different tracks. When you want some competition, take on the world and try to win the championship, or race against a friend for bragging rights. No matter how you race, there is plenty of action to go around in FASTEST LAP.",
