      {
        "id": 49013,
        "name": "Sports Illustrated: Championship Football & Baseball",
        "summary": "Sports Illustrated brings you two popular sporting events in one realistic package. Thrill to the non-stop action of professional football as you clash with a powerful opposing team or lead a baseball club to the championship in big league style. Its up to you to make all of the right moves and to power your squad past the competition.\n\nBoth sports feature great graphics, digitized voice samples and animated sequences that celebrate big plays. You'll feel as though you are actually at the stadium experiencing all of the excitement and glory that go with the real thing. Fade back for a touchdown pass, swing into a home run blast and have fun with an unbeatable sports duo...",
