        "id": 325876,
        "name": "Alentejo: Tinto's Law",
        "summary": "A Gundown Satiric Western, set in the 19th Century Iberian Penisula!\n\nTrains, outlaws, kegs, contraband. Welcome to 19th-century Alentejo, a land where the scorching sun and mysteries are ever-present. Meet Gildo and help him assemble his gang to stand against Baron Tinto's tyrannical rule. Travel across various locations, explore caves and mines, cross the border into Spain, and challenge Tinto and his oppressive lawmaking.",
