        "platform_ids": "22,33",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/tetris--41",
        "cached_at": 1772526002
      },
      {
        "id": 327558,
        "name": "Waking up in LS",
        "summary": "Waking up in LS is a short exploration videogame where you play as a usual citizen in \"Linha de Sintra\", the area where a railway link connects Lisbon and Sintra.\n\nAs a resident of this unique area, you'll come across a cast of bizarre and outlandish characters, each with their own hilarious quirks and idiosyncrasies.\n\nExplore Queluz´s train station, residential areas, and strange and surreal corners. You'll come across bizarre situations that will make you laugh out loud and shake your head in disbelief.\n\n\"Waking up in LS\" is a game that will keep you entertained and amused for a couple minutes, with its pixel art graphics, and a irreverent sense of humour. Whether you like exploration games or just want to laugh, \"Waking up in LS\" will make you smile and leave you wanting more.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co991f.jpg",
        "release_date": null,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
