      {
        "id": 343161,
        "name": "Illuyanka: A Hittite Story",
        "summary": "Illuyanka: A Hittite Story is an epic interactive journey set in the ancient world of the Hittites, where you can step into the roles of three powerful figures: Taru, the vengeful Storm God; Inara, his resourceful daughter; or Illuyanka, the mighty serpent. Each choice leads to a unique perspective on this timeless myth, filled with emotional depth, cultural richness, and intense conflict.\n\nAs Taru, you seek to reclaim your honor by vanquishing your old foe, Illuyanka, despite being blinded by rage and driven by the need for revenge. As Inara, you balance loyalty to your father with your own desires, weaving a plan that could either save your people or tear your heart apart. And as Illuyanka, you stand as the embodiment of raw, untamed nature, struggling to maintain your hold against the gods.\n\nExplore Hittite traditions, navigate divine politics, and experience the weight of decisions that shape both the human and divine realms. Will you restore balance to the land, or will chaos reign? The fate of Hatti is in your hands.\n\nYour choices shall shape the tale, yet you may always return or begin anew, perchance adopting another guise. Enjoy your journey, for the very act of recounting these ancient stories binds you to the age-old tradition of the bards and priests who first gave them voice.",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co9skk.jpg",
        "release_date": null,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Adventure|Indie|Visual Novel",
        "platform_ids": "82,33",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/illuyanka-a-hittite-story",
        "cached_at": 1772526002
      },
      {
        "id": 343167,
        "name": "Vermeer's Twilight",
        "summary": "A historically rich and emotionally immersive Game Boy adventure.\n\nVermeer's Twilight is an intimate and atmospheric journey into the mind of the painter Johannes Vermeer, set in the final years of his life. As the world around him changes and the golden age of Dutch art fades into uncertainty, the painter wanders through his home and the streets of Delft, reliving his greatest works and confronting the struggles of a life devoted to art.\n\nExplore the house and the city, uncover forgotten memories, and collect the paintings that define an era.\n\nWill Vermeer find meaning in the fading light, or will it vanish like the colors on his empty canvas?",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/co9shn.jpg",
        "release_date": null,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
        "genres": "Adventure|Indie",
        "platform_ids": "33",
        "external_url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/vermeers-twilight",
        "cached_at": 1772526002
