      {
        "id": 345355,
        "name": "Oshinui Tune",
        "summary": "Nothing happened... it was just an ordinary OshiNui... or so you thought.\n\nA uniquely designed STG (shoot 'em up) filled with charming pixel art and catchy chiptune music, made for fans of both! Bushinui, Ashinui, Kashinui… How many different plushie-favorites can you discover? What's the truth behind the rumor that you can meet your Oshi!?",
        "cover_url": "https://images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_cover_small/coa3c4.jpg",
        "release_date": 1746576000,
        "rating": null,
        "rating_count": null,
